<title>UK: LME zinc at fresh high, targets $1,700 a tonne.</title>
<headline>LME zinc at fresh high, targets $1,700 a tonne.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZINC - Hits a fresh seven year high of $1,645 a tonne on short-covering. Targets $1,700.</p>
<p>COPPER - Little changed. Seen higher towards $2,400 after</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Seen higher towards first resistance at $1,700.</p>
<p>OTHER METALS - Steady, looking to probe higher.</p>
</text>
